  "summary": "Determine if an integer is a power of three by checking if there exists an integer x such that the given number equals 3 raised to the power of x.",
  "statement": "Determine if an integer is a power of three by checking if there exists an integer x such that the given number equals 3 raised to the power of x.",
  "constraints": [
    "-(2^31) <= n <= 2^31-1. Return whether n = 3^x for a nonnegative integer x.",
    "1 is 3^0 and is valid. Zero, negatives, and multiples of 3 containing other factors are invalid."
